---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Me">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <a href="/" class="back-link">← Home</a>
    <p class="section-label">About Me</p>
    <h1>Plausible<br />PC Picks.</h1>
    <p>Hi, I'm Paul and I've been building computers since 2018 and have personally built 20+ desktops PCs. I have also helped countless others choose their next build. I just love staying up to date on modern hardware and finding good deals. If you're in the market for a new machine you found the right place. This website hosts my general recommendations and I do my best to keep things updated. If you have questions or want more personalized recommendations don't hesitate to reach out. </p>
  </section>

  <section class="page-content">
    <div class="section-label" style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">My Current Build</div>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Builds coming soon — check back shortly.</p>

    <div class="build-placeholder">
      🔧 Build recommendations will live here. Each card will include a full parts list, where to buy, and expected performance.
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-content">
    <!-- your content -->
  </section>
</BaseLayout>